(3198, 'Portable Neck Fan', 'portable-neck-fan-1782204703-2284', 1, 1, NULL, 50, NULL, '148', NULL, NULL, '<p><strong>Product Name :-&nbsp;</strong></p>\n\n<p>[Cooling &amp; Safe]The est designed portable hanging neck fan, with 48 wind outlets and 60pcs twin-turbine fan blades, multiplies wind power and can quickly feel cool in 3s. Bladeless neck fans can be used safely by children and the elderly. And you don&#39;t worry about getting your hair in. The neck fan will keep you cool always.<br />\n[Free Your Hands &amp; Fashion]Hand free neck fan was designed to look like a headphone, you can free your hands and have a fashion style. The hanging neck fan is lightweight and portable, you can take it anywhere. Can Be Suitable For Outdoor Sports, Indoor Exercises, Offices, Gym, Travelling, And Camping.<br />\n[USB Rechargeable &amp; 3 Speed Wind]USB rechargeable fan, convenient to charge via computer, cell phone charger, power bank, laptop, etc. Built-in 1800 mAh battery provides 2.5 to 7 working hours duration (depending on different speeds). 3 wind speeds can be adjusted at will to meet any needs of you.<br />\n[Low Noise Design &amp; Comfortable]The wearable personal fan&#39;s motor has been modified so that will produce lower noise during operation. Made of Eco-friendly ABS. Makes the hands-free neckband fan softer and more durable and quieter. Even if you wear a neck fan, you can have a quiet environment.<br />\n[Enjoy &amp; Service]Wear our hanging neck fan, you can be freer, more comfortable, more fashionable, and enjoy the coolness of summer everywhere and anytime.<br />\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Color: white , Green &amp; Pink&nbsp;<br />\nMaterial: ABS+PC<br />\nSize: 22.2x20.7x5.8cm</p>\n\n<p>Only the above package content, and other products are not included.<br />\nNote: displays may cause the color of the item in the picture a little different from the real thing. The measurement allowed error is +/- 1-3cm.</p>\n\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n	<tbody>\n		<tr>\n			<td>\n			<p><img src=\"https://static-01.daraz.com.bd/p/60345ba7c57465a8e02ed174cb58cbd4.jpg\" /></p>\n\n			<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n			<p><img src=\"https://static-01.daraz.com.bd/p/95933e7bb5cf306d6bc31084a3cc3d22.jpg\" /></p>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n	</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>Specifications of Portable Neck Fan Hands Free Bladeless Neck Fan, 360 Celsiusooling Hanging Fan, USB Rechargeable Personal Neck Fan</p>', '', 0, 1, 0, 0, 'Pc', '', 0, '', 0, '', 1, 0.00, 0, 7, 1, 0, '2026-06-23 08:51:43', '2026-06-23 08:51:43'),
(3199, 'Laxasfit S9 pro Smart Watch', 'laxasfit-s9-pro-smart-watch-1782204703-6367', 1, 1, NULL, 52, NULL, '149', NULL, NULL, '<h1><strong>Product details: Laxasfit S9 pro Smart Watch</strong></h1>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>The Laxasfit S9 Pro Smart Watch features a 45mm bandwidth, a built-in voice assistant, Bluetooth 5.1, and a TFT touch screen. It offers various activity-tracking functions like step, distance, calorie tracking, and sleep monitoring. The watch is waterproof, has multiple language options, and supports typical smartwatch functions. Brand: Laxasfit</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h1><strong>Specification :</strong></h1>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>\n	<p>Bandwidth [mm] :45mm</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>Sim card slot:no</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>Built-in voice assistant : YES</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>Bluetooth compatible version : 5.1</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>Metric measurement:Others, sleep monitor</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>Activity tracking :Others: step tracker, distance tracker, calorie tracker, activity tracker</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>Touch screen:YES</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>App name : Laxasfit</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>screen material : Tft</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>CPU model : 5609</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>Resolution : 240*296</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>Screen size:2.19 inch</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>Screen shape : SQUARE</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>Case material : ALLOY</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>Band material : ALLOY</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>Waterproof grade : Life waterproof</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>Sim card available :No</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>Multiple dials : Yes</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>System : Android wear, Original OS, Android OS, iOS</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>Language : English,Russian,Spanish,POLISH,Portuguese,Turkish,ITALIAN,French,Germany,Ukrainian,Dutch,Arabic,Indo</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>Function : Passometer, Fitness Tracker, Sleep Tracker, Message Reminder, Call Reminder, Answer Call, Dial Call,</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>Brand name :&nbsp;<strong>LAXASFIT</strong></p>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h1><strong>Specifications:&nbsp;</strong>Laxasfit S9 pro Smart Watch</h1>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Sim Support : No</li>\n	<li>Sim Slots : N/A</li>\n	<li>Strap Material : Silicon</li>\n</ul>', '', 1, 1, 0, 0, 'Pc', '', 0, '', 0, '', 1, 0.00, 0, 8, 1, 0, '2026-06-23 08:51:43', '2026-06-23 08:51:43'),
(3200, 'Airpod Pro 2 Generation with Touch Screen Display (White)', 'airpod-pro-2-generation-with-touch-screen-display-(white)-1782204703-7930', 1, 1, NULL, 52, NULL, '150', NULL, NULL, '<h1><strong>Product details:</strong>&nbsp;Airpod Pro 2 Generation with Touch Screen Display.</h1>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Type: AirPods Pro</li>\n	<li>Connectivity Type: Wireless</li>\n	<li>Generation: 2&zwnj;nd Generation</li>\n	<li>Model Name/Number: New Airpods Pro 2&zwnj; With Screen</li>\n	<li>Color: White Compatible With ALL</li>\n	<li>Warranty: CHECK WARRANTY</li>\n	<li>Call Control: yes</li>\n	<li>Call Reject: yes</li>\n	<li>Music time:12h</li>\n	<li>play time: 12h</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2><strong>Product Description</strong></h2>\n\n<p>Airpods Pro ANC/ENC DISPLAY Original quality Display All sensors working With Free transparent case BEST QUALITY</p>\n\n<p>Convenient Controls: Quickly adjust volume, switch between noise reduction and transparent modes, set equalizer levels and more using the intuitive touch controls.</p>\n\n<p>Comfortable Fit: Soft silicone eartips come in multiple sizes to provide a comfortable seal that enhances the listening experience.</p>\n\n<p>Clear Calls: An integrated microphone in each earbud allows for crisp, hands-free calls without background noise interference.</p>\n\n<p>Long Battery Life: A single charge provides up to 6 hours of playtime, and the compact charging case delivers an additional 3 full charges on-the-go.</p>\n\n<p>Universal Compatibility: Easily pair with any Bluetooth enabled device within a 30 foot range, including smartphones, tablets and laptops.</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"airpods pro 2 lcd screen\" src=\"https://airpods.pk/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/airpods-pro-2-lcd-screen.webp\" /></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"airpods pro 2 with touch display\" src=\"https://airpods.pk/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/airpods-pro-2-with-touch-display.webp\" /></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"airpods pro 2 touch screen\" src=\"https://airpods.pk/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/airpods-pro-2-touch-screen.webp\" /></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"touch screen display airpods pro 2\" src=\"https://airpods.pk/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/touch-screen-display-airpods-pro-2-769x1024.webp\" /></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"airpods pro 2 touch screen 1\" src=\"https://airpods.pk/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/airpods-pro-2-touch-screen-1-671x1024.webp\" /></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"airpods pro 2 lcd display\" src=\"https://airpods.pk/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/airpods-pro-2-lcd-display-403x1024.webp\" /></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"airpods pro 2 touch screen airpods\" src=\"https://airpods.pk/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/airpods-pro-2-touch-screen-airpods-574x1024.webp\" /></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"airpods pro 2 touch display\" src=\"https://airpods.pk/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/airpods-pro-2-touch-display-706x1024.webp\" /></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"touch display airpods pro 2\" src=\"https://airpods.pk/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/touch-display-airpods-pro-2-616x1024.webp\" /></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"lcd display airpods pro 2\" src=\"https://airpods.pk/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/lcd-display-airpods-pro-2-539x1024.webp\" /></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"lcd screen airpods pro 2\" src=\"https://airpods.pk/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/lcd-screen-airpods-pro-2-562x1024.webp\" /></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"touch screen airpods pro 2\" src=\"https://airpods.pk/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/touch-screen-airpods-pro-2-548x1024.webp\" /></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"airpods pro 2 touch screen display\" src=\"https://airpods.pk/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/airpods-pro-2-touch-screen-display-641x1024.webp\" /></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"airpods pro 2 touch display 1\" src=\"https://airpods.pk/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/airpods-pro-2-touch-display-1-643x1024.webp\" /></p>\n\n<h2>Specifications of ANC ENC New Airpods Pro 2 With display Screen,2nd Generation</h2>\n\n<h2>What&rsquo;s in the box : Airpod Pro 2 Generation with Touch Screen Display</h2>', '', 1, 1, 0, 0, 'Pc', '', 0, '', 0, '', 1, 0.00, 0, 9, 1, 0, '2026-06-23 08:51:43', '2026-06-23 08:51:43'),
(3201, 'Vintage T9 Electric Hair Clipper Trimmer', 'vintage-t9-electric-hair-clipper-trimmer-1782204703-2213', 1, 1, NULL, 53, NULL, '151', NULL, NULL, '<h2>Product details :&nbsp;Vintage T9 Electric Hair Clipper Trimmer</h2>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Cordless Electric Shaver :No more tangled cords! This cordless electric shaver is easy to use and perfect for travel.</li>\n	<li>&bull; Hair Cutting Machine :Say goodbye to messy haircuts and hello to a precise and clean cut with this hair cutting machine.</li>\n	<li>&bull; USB Charging :Charge your device on the go with the convenient USB charging feature.</li>\n	<li>&bull; Adjustable Cutting Length :Customize your haircut with the adjustable cutting length, allowing you to achieve the perfect look.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Cordless Electric Shaver :No more tangled cords! This cordless electric shaver is easy to use and perfect for travel.</li>\n	<li>&bull; Hair Cutting Machine :Say goodbye to messy haircuts and hello to a precise and clean cut with this hair cutting machine.</li>\n	<li>&bull; USB Charging :Charge your device on the go with the convenient USB charging feature.</li>\n	<li>&bull; Adjustable Cutting Length :Customize your haircut with the adjustable cutting length, allowing you to achieve the perfect look.<img src=\"https://img.drz.lazcdn.com/static/bd/p/55317e5f324b95a50eea981db5f90101.jpg_2200x2200q80.jpg_.webp\" /></li>\n</ul>', '', 0, 1, 0, 0, 'Pc', '', 0, '', 0, '', 1, 0.00, 0, 10, 1, 0, '2026-06-23 08:51:43', '2026-06-23 08:51:43'),
(3202, 'AirPods Pro (2nd generation) White', 'airpods-pro-(2nd-generation)-white-1782204703-9136', 1, 1, NULL, 52, NULL, '152', NULL, NULL, '<h1><strong>Product details:</strong></h1>\n\n<h2>Apple AirPods Pro (2nd Generation) Wireless Earbuds with MagSafe Charging Case. Active Noise Cancelling, Personalized Spatial Audio, Customizable Fit, Bluetooth Headphones for iPhone</h2>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Active Noise Cancellation reduces unwanted background noise</li>\n	<li>Adaptive Transparency lets outside sounds in while reducing loud environmental noise</li>\n	<li>Personalized Spatial Audio with dynamic head tracking places sound all around you</li>\n	<li>Multiple ear tips (XS, S, M, L)</li>\n	<li>Touch control lets you swipe to adjust volume, press to direct media playback, answer or end calls, and press and hold to switch between listening modes</li>\n	<li>Sweat and water resistant for AirPods Pro and charging case</li>\n	<li>MagSafe Charging Case with speaker and lanyard loop</li>\n	<li>Up to 6 hours of listening time with Active Noise Cancellation on</li>\n	<li>Up to 30 hours of total listening time with the MagSafe Charging Case and Active Noise Cancellation on</li>\n	<li>Quick access to Siri by saying &ldquo;Hey Siri&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h1><strong>Specifications:</strong></h1>\n\n<h2>&nbsp;Apple AirPods Pro (2nd Generation) Wireless Earbuds with MagSafe Charging Case. Active Noise Cancelling, Personalized Spatial Audio, Customizable Fit, Bluetooth Headphones for iPhone.</h2>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Brand\n	<p>AirPods Pro (2nd Generation) Dubai.</p>\n	</li>\n</ul>', '', 1, 1, 0, 0, 'Pc', '', 0, '', 0, '', 1, 0.00, 0, 11, 1, 0, '2026-06-23 08:51:43', '2026-06-23 08:51:43'),
(3203, 'Digital Blood Pressure Monitor', 'digital-blood-pressure-monitor-1782204703-5250', 1, 1, NULL, 51, NULL, '153', NULL, NULL, '<p><strong>Product Details :- Digital Blood Pressure Monitor</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>১। রক্তচাপ নির্ণয়ে সঠিক ফলাফল দিবে এই ডিজিটাল ব্লাড প্রেসার মনিটর।</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>২। এক বার রক্তচাপ মাপার পর অন্তত ১০ মিনিট পরে আবার রক্তচাপ মাপুন।</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>৩। প্রেসার মাপার পর রেজাল্ট মনিটরে দেখা যায় এবং স্পিকারে স্পষ্ট ভাবে বলে দেয়।</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>৪। এটি পেন্সিল ব্যাটারী ও USB চার্জার দিয়ে চালাতে পারবেন।</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>৫। এটির ওজন খুব কম তাই সহজে বহনযোগ্য।</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>৬। ইহার ফাংশন খুবই সহজ তাই নিরক্ষর মানুষও ব্যবহার করতে পারবে।</strong></p>', '', 1, 1, 0, 0, 'Pc', '', 0, '', 0, '', 1, 0.00, 0, 12, 1, 0, '2026-06-23 08:51:43', '2026-06-23 08:51:43'),
