(3208, 'Electric Panci Non-stick Mini Rice Cooker', 'electric-panci-non-stick-mini-rice-cooker-1782204703-9004', 1, 1, NULL, 55, NULL, '158', NULL, NULL, '<h3><strong>Product Summary &amp; Specification</strong></h3>\n\n<p>This mini electric rice cooker is a versatile kitchen appliance that can be used to cook a variety of dishes, including rice, soup, noodles, hot pot, and even eggs. It has a capacity of 500gm, which is enough to feed 1-2 people. The cooker has two adjustable temperature controls, so you can cook your food to your desired doneness. It also has a transparent glass lid, so you can see your food cooking without having to open the cooker.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Full Specification :&nbsp;</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>\n	<p>Product Type : Rice Cooker</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>Voltage : 220V</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>Power : 300W-600W</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>Capacity : 500 gm</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>Steam rack large enough to fit up to 7 Eggs/Momo Can be Cook, Fry, Steam, Boil Easy to use</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>Material : Stainless steel PP</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>Voltage 220V 50Hz/Power 350W</p>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://img.drz.lazcdn.com/static/bd/p/985ced8de901829ad5c47e56af401dca.png_2200x2200q80.png_.webp\" /><img src=\"https://img.drz.lazcdn.com/static/bd/p/fa5589a97b644ca0eb74133b743b7bb2.png_2200x2200q80.png_.webp\" /><img src=\"https://img.drz.lazcdn.com/static/bd/p/bccaa086c55c7726736994fc3c664251.png_2200x2200q80.png_.webp\" /><img src=\"https://img.drz.lazcdn.com/static/bd/p/01c7e6c4e4acc1153937a44480012b4f.png_2200x2200q80.png_.webp\" /><img src=\"https://img.drz.lazcdn.com/static/bd/p/5dedeffaa88c476cf4090a4092068cca.png_2200x2200q80.png_.webp\" /></p>', '', 1, 1, 0, 0, 'Pc', '', 0, '', 0, '', 1, 0.00, 0, 17, 0, 0, '2026-06-23 08:51:43', '2026-06-23 08:51:43'),
(3209, 'Ultrapods Max Wireless Earbuds 5.3 Transparent.', 'ultrapods-max-wireless-earbuds-5.3-transparent.-1782204704-1196', 1, 1, NULL, 52, NULL, '159', NULL, NULL, '<h2><strong>Product details :</strong></h2>\n\n<h2>Original T2 UltraPods Max TWS Headphones 5.3 Wireless Earphones Bluetooth Headset With Auto Noise Cancelling HD HiFi Stereo Earbuds</h2>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>&bull; Wireless Bluetooth with HiFi stereo sound for immersive audio experience</li>\n	<li>&bull; Transparent 3D display and case for a modern look</li>\n	<li>&bull; Sweat proof, water resistant, and noise isolating features</li>\n	<li>&bull; Built-in microphone and auto noise cancelling for clear calls</li>\n	<li>&bull; On-ear wearing type for comfortable and secure fit&bull; transparent&bull; RGB lighting</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>- Bluetooth: Yes<br />\n- Display Resolution: 3D display<br />\n- Electronics Features: Transparent<br />\n- Case Type: Transparent<br />\n- categoryPath: TV, Audio / Video, Gaming &amp; Wearables, Audio, Headphones &amp; Headsets, Wireless Earbuds<br />\n- Speakers Config: HiFi stereo sound<br />\n- Headphone Features: Sweat Proof, Water Resistant, Noise Isolating, Built-in Microphone, Noise Cancellation<br />\n- wearing_type: On-Ear<br />\n- productTitle: Original T2 UltraPods Max TWS Headphones 5.3 Wireless Earphones Bluetooth Headset With Auto Noise Cancelling HD HiFi Stereo Earbuds<br />\n- Generation: Generation 2 (Gen-2)<br />\n- Model: T-2 UltraPods pro Max Tws<br />\n- no_of_hdmi_ports: Type C port<br />\n- Wireless Connectivity: WIFI + Bluetooth<br />\n<br />\nIntroducing the Original T2 UltraPods Max TWS Headphones 5.3, the ultimate wireless earphones with Bluetooth connectivity and auto noise cancelling. These on-ear headphones feature a 3D display resolution and transparent case, delivering HiFi stereo sound for an immersive listening experience. With sweat-proof and water-resistant design, along with noise isolation and cancellation, these headphones are perfect for active lifestyles. The built-in microphone ensures seamless communication, while the Type C port and WIFI + Bluetooth connectivity offer versatile usage. Upgrade to the Generation 2 (Gen-2) T-2 UltraPods pro Max Tws for an unparalleled audio experience.<br />\n<br />\nStep 4:<br />\nThe tone of voice is in accordance with Informative. No amendments needed.<br />\n<br />\nFinal Product Description:<br />\nIntroducing the Original T2 UltraPods Max TWS Headphones 5.3, the ultimate wireless earphones with Bluetooth connectivity and auto noise cancelling. These on-ear headphones feature a 3D display resolution and transparent case, delivering HiFi stereo sound for an immersive listening experience. With sweat-proof and water-resistant design, along with noise isolation and cancellation, these headphones are perfect for active lifestyles. The built-in microphone ensures seamless communication, while the Type C port and WIFI + Bluetooth connectivity offer versatile usage. Upgrade to the Generation 2 (Gen-2) T-2 UltraPods pro Max Tws for an unparalleled audio experience.<img src=\"https://bd-live-21.slatic.net/kf/Sceb4d4067c2744e295abf76d21b3100dG.jpg\" /></p>\n\n<h2><strong>Specifications :</strong></h2>\n\n<h2>Original T2 UltraPods Max TWS Headphones 5.3 Wireless Earphones Bluetooth Headset With Auto Noise Cancelling HD HiFi Stereo Earbuds</h2>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Brand : No Brand.</li>\n	<li>wireless_connectivity : WIFI + Bluetooth</li>\n	<li>Headphone Features : Sweat Proof,Water Resistant,Noise Isolating,Built in Microphone,Noise Cancellation.</li>\n	<li>Speakers Config : HiFi stereo sound.</li>\n	<li>Display Resolution : 3D display.</li>\n	<li>Bluetooth : Yes.</li>\n	<li>wired : wireless Bluetooth.</li>\n	<li>case_type : Transparent.</li>\n	<li>generation : Generation 2 (Gen-2).</li>\n	<li>wearing_type : On-Ear.</li>\n	<li>Model : T-2 UltraPods pro Max Tws.</li>\n	<li>Electronics Features : Transparent.</li>\n	<li>no_of_hdmi_ports : Type C port</li>\n</ul>', '', 1, 1, 0, 0, 'Pc', '', 0, '', 0, '', 1, 0.00, 0, 18, 0, 0, '2026-06-23 08:51:44', '2026-06-23 08:51:44');
