(3210, 'Hoco W35 Max Wireless Headphone', 'hoco-w35-max-wireless-headphone-1782204704-8206', 1, 1, NULL, 52, NULL, '160', NULL, NULL, '<p><strong>Hoco W35 Max ANC Wireless Headphone &nbsp;&ndash; Discover Premium Sound with Hoco</strong></p>\n\n<p>If you&rsquo;re looking for a quality&nbsp;<strong>wireless headphone price in BD</strong>&nbsp;that delivers premium sound and active noise cancellation at an affordable price, the&nbsp;<strong>Hoco W35 Max ANC Wireless Headphone</strong>&nbsp;is a top choice. Priced attractively at&nbsp;<strong>Hoco Bangladesh</strong>, these headphones offer impressive performance with features designed to elevate your listening experience. With a&nbsp;<strong>focus on comfort, battery life, and advanced connectivity</strong>, the&nbsp;<strong>Hoco W35 Max ANC</strong>&nbsp;ensures you can enjoy an uninterrupted audio experience whether for&nbsp;<strong>gaming, music, or calls</strong>.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Specification :-&nbsp;Hoco W35 Max&nbsp;</strong></p>\n\n<table>\n	<tbody>\n		<tr>\n			<td>Brand</td>\n			<td>Hoco</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td>Bluetooth</td>\n			<td>Version 5.3 | Low Power Consumption | Stable Connection</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td>Charging Interface</td>\n			<td>USB Type-C (DC 5V)</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td>Model</td>\n			<td>W35 Max Wireless Headphone</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td>Battery capacity</td>\n			<td>800mAh | Charging Time: About 2 Hours | Standby Time: 200 Hours</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td>Latency</td>\n			<td>Low Latency</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td>Driver Size</td>\n			<td>40mm Dynamic Coil Sound Unit | Hi-Fi Sound Quality | Penetrating Treble</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td>Playtime</td>\n			<td>Up To 90 Hours (Music/Calling Time)</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td>Other Features / Info</td>\n			<td>Volume Control Knob (Volume Adjustment, Play/Pause, Nex Track Or Previous Track) | Triple Mode Playback: Bluetooth, AUX, TF Card | 90&deg; Rotation Adjustment&nbsp;</td>\n		</tr>\n	</tbody>\n</table>', '', 1, 1, 0, 0, 'Pc', '', 0, '', 0, '', 1, 0.00, 0, 19, 0, 0, '2026-06-23 08:51:44', '2026-06-23 08:51:44'),
(3211, 'Y80 Ultra Smartwatch With 8 Strap', 'y80-ultra-smartwatch-with-8-strap-1782204704-6555', 1, 1, NULL, 52, NULL, '161', NULL, NULL, '<p>The Y80 Ultra Smartwatch With 8 Strap is now available in Bangladesh. Get the original products at the most affordable price only at Doshbish.com and enjoy the quality with the promise of the best customer service in Bangladesh.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>The Y80 Ultra Smartwatch is available in a variety of colors, including black, white, blue, and pink. It is also available with a variety of straps, including silicone, leather, and metal.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Features:</p>\n\n<p>Touch Screen</p>\n\n<p>Auto Focus</p>\n\n<p>APP Control</p>\n\n<p>IP68 Water Resistant</p>\n\n<p>Specifications:</p>\n\n<p>Model: Ultra Y80</p>\n\n<p>Design: Flip</p>\n\n<p>Screen size: 2.02&Prime;</p>\n\n<p>Resolution: 240*284 IPS</p>\n\n<p>Bluetooth: BT5.0</p>\n\n<p>Capacity: 240mAh</p>\n\n<p>Materials : PU+TPU, Silicone, Leather</p>\n\n<p>Charging Method: Wireless Charging</p>\n\n<p>Function: Lighting, Calendar, Alarm Clock, Week, Month</p>\n\n<p>WiFi, Bluetooth, IP68 Water Resistant</p>', '', 1, 1, 0, 0, 'Pc', '', 0, '', 0, '', 1, 0.00, 0, 20, 0, 0, '2026-06-23 08:51:44', '2026-06-23 08:51:44'),
(3212, 'President Tory Arabian Jubba PT100', 'president-tory-arabian-jubba-pt100-1782204704-2937', 1, 1, NULL, 56, 67, '162', NULL, NULL, '<h3><strong>President Tory Arabian Jubba</strong></h3>\n\n<p>Elevate your style with the <strong>President Tory Arabian Jubba</strong>, crafted with premium fabric for a luxurious and comfortable wear. Designed with a perfect blend of elegance and tradition, this jubba is ideal for daily use, prayer, and special occasions.</p>\n\n<p>✨ <strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>\n	<p>Premium quality Arabian fabric with a soft, breathable finish</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>Modern Tory-style cut with a classic Arabian touch</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>Full-length design ensuring comfort and modesty</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>Elegant stitching with durable craftsmanship</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>Available in multiple sizes for a perfect fit</p>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>👔 <strong>Perfect For:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>\n	<p>Prayer, Jummah, and Islamic gatherings</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>Casual wear with a refined look</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>Special occasions &amp; festive wear</p>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Bring a touch of sophistication to your wardrobe with the <strong>President Tory Arabian Jubba</strong> &ndash; where tradition meets modern style.</p>', '', 1, 1, 0, 0, 'Pc', '', 0, '', 0, '', 1, 0.00, 0, 21, 0, 0, '2026-06-23 08:51:44', '2026-06-23 08:51:44'),
