m + ABS+PS</h2>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<h2><strong>Product Dimension:</strong>&nbsp;51*39*100mm</h2>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<h2><strong>Production Weight:&nbsp;</strong>70.4g</h2>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<h2><strong>Lighting time:</strong>&nbsp;4 H (1.5H for high light)</h2>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<h2><strong>Life time:&nbsp;</strong>50000 H</h2>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2><strong>Function:</strong></h2>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>\n	<h3>&nbsp;Lighting (6 types)</h3>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<h3>&nbsp;Carabiner &amp; cutter</h3>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<h3>&nbsp;Cigarette lighter</h3>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<h3>&nbsp;Screwdriver</h3>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<h3>&nbsp;Whistle</h3>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<h3>&nbsp;Bottle opener</h3>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<h3>&nbsp;Magnet adsorption</h3>\n	</li>\n</ul>', '', 1, 1, 0, 0, 'Pc', '', 0, '', 0, '', 1, 0.00, 0, 36, 0, 0, '2026-06-23 08:51:45', '2026-06-23 08:51:45'),
(3228, 'JOYROOM T03s PRO 2 ANC Noise Cancellation Bluetooth Earbuds', 'joyroom-t03s-pro-2-anc-noise-cancellation-bluetooth-earbuds-1782204705-8214', 1, 1, NULL, 52, NULL, '178', NULL, NULL, '<h1><strong>Product Description :&nbsp;</strong>JOYROOM&nbsp; T03s PRO 2 ANC Noise Cancellation Bluetooth Earbuds.</h1>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>The Joyroom JR-T03S Pro 2 Wireless Earbuds in sleek white, paired with a stylish thin red case, represent the pinnacle of modern audio technology and design. Engineered for both aesthetics and performance, these earbuds deliver a superior listening experience with their advanced features and cutting-edge technology.</li>\n	<li>Bluetooth 5.2 technology ensures seamless and stable connectivity, allowing you to enjoy uninterrupted sound and clear calls. The 13mm speakers provide a robust sound experience with deep bass and clear highs, enhancing every note with high-fidelity audio. The earbuds boast a frequency response range of 20Hz to 20kHz, ensuring a full spectrum of sound reproduction.</li>\n	<li>Designed for convenience, these earbuds offer 7 hours of sound playtime on a single charge at 70% volume, with a quick 1-hour charging time for both the earbuds and the case. The 360mAh charging case supports extended usage and can keep your earbuds powered for longer periods. Additionally, the case&rsquo;s standby time exceeds 6 months, ensuring that your earbuds are always ready to go.</li>\n	<li>The Joyroom JR-T03S Pro 2 features active noise cancelling (ANC) with a depth of 25dB, reducing ambient noise to help you focus on your sound or calls. The 13mm diameter speakers expand the sound field and provide a high-quality bass effect, making every listening session immersive. The earbuds come with various silicone ear tips for a customizable fit, ensuring a stable and sealed experience.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h1><strong>Product details :&nbsp;</strong>JOYROOM&nbsp;T03s PRO 2</h1>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Brand&nbsp;</strong>：JOYROOM&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>Model :</strong>&nbsp;JR-T03s Pro</li>\n	<li><strong>Wearing method :</strong>&nbsp;in-ear</li>\n	<li><strong>Bluetooth&nbsp;:</strong>&nbsp;V5.2</li>\n	<li><strong>Earphone battery capacity :&nbsp;</strong>30mAh</li>\n	<li><strong>Charging case battery capacity :</strong>&nbsp;360mAh</li>\n	<li><strong>sound time :</strong>&nbsp;2 ~ 3h</li>\n	<li><strong>Call time :</strong>&nbsp;2 ~ 3h</li>\n	<li><strong>Charging time of charging case :</strong>&nbsp;1.3 hours</li>\n	<li><strong>Charging time of earphone :</strong>&nbsp;1.2 hours</li>\n</ul>', '', 0, 1, 0, 0, 'Pc', '', 0, '', 0, '', 1, 0.00, 0, 37, 0, 0, '2026-06-23 08:51:45', '2026-06-23 08:51:45'),
(3229, 'SIM Supported Kids Smart Watch (Smartberry C005)', 'sim-supported-kids-smart-watch-(smartberry-c005)-1782204705-2029', 1, 1, NULL, 52, NULL, '179', NULL, NULL, '<h3><strong>Product details :</strong>&nbsp;SIM Supported Kids Smart Watch (Smartberry C005)</h3>\n\n<table>\n	<thead>\n		<tr>\n			<td colspan=\"2\">\n			<h3><strong>Smart Watch</strong></h3>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n	</thead>\n	<tbody>\n		<tr>\n			<td>\n			<h3>Charging Type</h3>\n			</td>\n			<td>\n			<h3>2PIN charging, magnetic suction</h3>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td>\n			<h3>Display</h3>\n			</td>\n			<td>\n			<h3>LCD Size 1.44 inch 128*128 TN</h3>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td>\n			<h3>Battery</h3>\n			</td>\n			<td>\n			<h3>Built-in, wire bonding/520mA</h3>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td>\n			<h3>Connectivity</h3>\n			</td>\n			<td>\n			<h3>Bluetooth , USB 2.0</h3>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td>\n			<h3>OS</h3>\n			</td>\n			<td>\n			<h3>Android &amp; IOS</h3>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td>\n			<h3>Memory</h3>\n			</td>\n			<td>\n			<h3>32MB+24MB</h3>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td>\n			<h3>Processor</h3>\n			</td>\n			<td>\n			<h3>RDA8955</h3>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td>\n			<h3>Color</h3>\n			</td>\n			<td>\n			<h3>Black, Sky Blue,&nbsp;</h3>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td>\n			<h3>Special Features</h3>\n			</td>\n			<td>\n			<h3>Nano SIM Support</h3>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n	</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h1>&nbsp;</h1>\n\n<h1><strong>SIM Supported Kids Smart Watch (Smartberry C005)</strong></h1>\n\n<p>This smartwatch display is 1.44 inch LCD and the resolution is 128*128 TN Viewing angle range. The Touch Panel is Screen Touch. The chipset is RDA8955 and the Flash 32MB + 24MB. This smartwatch has a Speaker and microphone. The battery is&nbsp;Built-in, wire bonding/520mA.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.famousgadget.com.bd/image/catalog/Smartwatch/0-no-brand/c005-2.jpeg\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.famousgadget.com.bd/image/catalog/Smartwatch/0-no-brand/c005-1.jpeg\" /></p>', '', 0, 1, 0, 0, 'Pc', '', 0, '', 0, '', 1, 0.00, 0, 38, 0, 0, '2026-06-23 08:51:45', '2026-06-23 08:51:45'),
(3230, 'Multifunctional Electric Grinding Machine', 'multifunctional-electric-grinding-machine-1782204705-8115', 1, 1, NULL, 55, NULL, '180', NULL, NULL, '<h1>Portable Multifunctional Electric Grinding Machine</h1>\n\n<p>30 seconds fast powder, challenge 60 mesh screen<br />\nGrinders for all materials: coffee beans, grains, pills, spices, herbs</p>\n\n<p>Choose different materials :&nbsp;Multifunctional Electric Grinding Machine</p>\n\n<p>Hidden power cord and widened base are more secure</p>\n\n<p>Let go and stop</p>\n\n<p>Exclusive portable holder</p>\n\n<p>Power 600W, Over 35,000 Rpm Motor speed</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://img.drz.lazcdn.com/static/pk/p/dada043fdbc485de81af038f552a5b02.jpg_2200x2200q80.jpg_.webp\" /><img alt=\"222.webp [webp-to-jpg output image]\" src=\"https://s6.ezgif.com/tmp/ezgif-6a143e142e2dd5.jpg\" /><img src=\"https://img.drz.lazcdn.com/static/pk/p/2dcc7674b89091b8deb1fb49f15a16e4.jpg_2200x2200q80.jpg_.webp\" /><img src=\"https://img.drz.lazcdn.com/static/pk/p/e3f5e45d42034c6d937d06f8261ba8c5.jpg_2200x2200q80.jpg_.webp\" /></p>', '', 0, 1, 0, 0, 'Pc', '', 0, '', 0, '', 1, 0.00, 0, 39, 0, 0, '2026-06-23 08:51:45', '2026-06-23 08:51:45'),
(3231, 'Multifunctional 2 In 1 Egg Opener', 'multifunctional-2-in-1-egg-opener-1782204705-1737', 1, 1, NULL, 55, NULL, '181', NULL, NULL, '<p><strong>Product Details :-&nbsp;</strong>Fast and efficient separation</p>\n\n<p>in one step of egg beats and egg whites</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"undefined\" src=\"https://cdn.techcloudly.com/image/2022/11/feefaf41b537eb9073ac6e0ad0f819bc70c9515ff5436782fc6ac1e0883027c3.gif\" /></p>\n\n<h2><strong>Features</strong></h2>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>【EASY TO USE】There is an egg holder under the egg opener, just simply put egg or duck egg on the holder, squeeze the egg cracking tool to break the eggshell, then separate the eggshell opener to make sure egg yolk and white filter by egg white separator.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><img alt=\"undefined\" src=\"https://cdn.techcloudly.com/image/95d13e84d0feb94c9d2272a8ba6796a7c3300b15.jpeg\" /></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>【QUICKER SEPARATE EGG WHITE AND EGG YOLK AFTER IMPROVED DESIGN】Unlike other traditional egg separator tool with 2 holes, our egg extractor upgraded streamlined 3 hole hollow design which allows egg yolks whites fully separate for baking and cooking needs. Note: shaking slowly will get quicker separate.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><img alt=\"undefined\" src=\"https://cdn.techcloudly.com/image/9a76ed8a6ef6dd830769bb951b9197b79c56a5c2.jpeg\" /></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>【NO KITCHEN MESS &amp; NO DIRTY HANDS】Our creative egg gadgets tool combines the function of egg cracker and egg separator, eggshell cutter can crack eggshell without causing kitchen mess or shell pieces and can quickly open eggs or duck eggs not dirty hands.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><img alt=\"undefined\" src=\"https://cdn.techcloudly.com/image/36e2b1f5bc0dbef9936ca065498d73bde1f8a370.jpeg\" /></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>【SAVE TIME AND EFFORT】Our egg separator tool can help you to improve cooking efficiency if you need to crack a lot of eggs. Egg cutter is an essential cooking baker tool for home bakers and commercial kitchens alike. Great to use at home or in restaurant.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><img alt=\"undefined\" src=\"https://cdn.techcloudly.com/image/e2aaf31a6db391c0d48ebd2b2022e56d7b672a0e.jpeg\" /></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>【SUS 304 FOOD GRADE STAINLESS STEEL &amp; DISHWASHER SAFE】Our eggshell cracker is made of SUS 304 food grade stainless steel material, comfortable ABS hand grip, stable egg holder and high quality spring, no rusting, durable and safe. Dishwasher-safe, easy to clean.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><img alt=\"undefined\" src=\"https://cdn.techcloudly.com/image/ce57e7edf548e7c2a697a117f9a3435134673069.jpeg\" /></p>\n\n<p><strong>Specifications :-</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Material: Food grade ABS + food grade</li>\n	<li>Color: Grey</li>\n	<li>Product size: 21.9*10cm</li>\n	<li>Product weight: 145g</li>\n	<li>Weight with color box: 189g (including egg white separator)</li>\n	<li>Package content : 1 x multi-functional egg opener 2 in 1 + 1 x egg white separato</li>\n</ul>', '', 1, 1, 0, 0, 'Pc', '', 0, '', 0, '', 1, 0.00, 0, 40, 0, 0, '2026-06-23 08:51:45', '2026-06-23 08:51:45'),
(3232, 'Nasal Breathing Dilator', 'nasal-breathing-dilator-1782204705-9162', 1, 1, NULL, 51, NULL, '182', NULL, NULL, '<ul>\n	<li>PATENTED TECHNOLOGY - Patented two-part nasal dilator uses dual strips and a magnetic band to maximize airflow, opening nasal passages for optimal breathing. Its innovative design ensures a personalized and comfortable fit for every user.</li>\n	<li>COMFORTABLE &amp; DURABLE - Comfortable and durable, the external relief band avoids nose bridge pressure, offering a more effective, lasting solution than traditional nasal strips or sprays, ensuring a superior and comfortable experience for users.</li>\n	<li>REDUCES SNORING - Safe and effective anti-snore device improves nasal airflow, reduces snoring, and enhances sleep quality for you and your partner. Boost oxygen levels, reduce stress, and increase energy for better performance and daily vitality.</li>\n	<li>SAFE &amp; EFFECTIVE - Nasal dilators pair well with nasal sprays and neti pots for congestion relief and snoring reduction. Safe, drug-free, and latex-free, they&rsquo;re doctor-recommended as the top anti-mouth breathing and anti-snoring solution.</li>\n	<li>EASY TO USE - The Snoring Aid Starter Kits include everything you need: four reusable relief bands in different sizes for a perfect fit, 15 or 15single-use nose breathing strips, and a magnetic applicator for easy application.</li>\n</ul>', '', 1, 1, 0, 0, 'Pc', '', 0, '', 0, '', 1, 0.00, 0, 41, 0, 0, '2026-06-23 08:51:45', '2026-06-23 08:51:45'),
