(3252, 'Automaic Water Diepenser', 'automaic-water-diepenser-1782204722-1455', 1, 1, NULL, 55, NULL, '206', NULL, NULL, '<p><strong>১ বার প্রেস করুন পানি অটোমেটিক উপরে উঠবে |</strong><br />\nmini water pump -USB Water Dispenser-Rechargeable Water Pump<br />\nএই গরমে পানি তোলার জন্য আর ঝামেলা নেই।<br />\nযেকোন বোতলে কাজ করবে এই রিচার্জেবল পাম্প টি।<br />\nপানি তেল সহ যেকোন লিকুইড তোলা যাবে।<br />\n<br />\n১০০% অরিজিনাল চায়না প্রোডাক্ট...<br />\nHousing Material: Stainless Steel<br />\nDimensions (L x WxH (Inches): 2.9*5.1 inch<br />\nPower (W): 3.8W<br />\nVoltage (V): 110V-220V</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://img.drz.lazcdn.com/static/bd/p/17eb1a686f6faefb42b7a1800dd7800b.jpg_2200x2200q80.jpg_.webp\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://img.drz.lazcdn.com/static/bd/p/b27b9c72e4f3a332ef173ac251393a53.jpg_2200x2200q80.jpg_.webp\" /></p>', '', 0, 1, 0, 0, 'Pc', '', 0, '', 0, '', 1, 0.00, 0, 63, 0, 0, '2026-06-23 08:52:02', '2026-06-23 08:52:02'),
(3253, 'Y20 Ultra  Smart Watch With 7 Straps', 'y20-ultra--smart-watch-with-7-straps-1782204722-7346', 1, 1, NULL, 52, NULL, '207', NULL, NULL, '<table>\n	<tbody>\n		<tr>\n			<th scope=\"row\">Item</th>\n			<td><a href=\"https://www.bdstall.com/smartwatch/\">Smart Watch</a></td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<th scope=\"row\">Type</th>\n			<td>Smart Watch</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<th scope=\"row\">Display</th>\n			<td>2.2 inch TFT HD large Screen</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<th scope=\"row\">Connectivity</th>\n			<td>Bluetooth</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<th scope=\"row\">Battery</th>\n			<td>320mAh</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<th scope=\"row\">Software</th>\n			<td>Qrunning</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<th scope=\"row\">Operating System</th>\n			<td>Android</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<th scope=\"row\">Protection</th>\n			<td>Non-Waterproof</td>\n		</tr>\n	</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Charging Time: About 1-2 hour</li>\n	<li>Voice Control</li>\n	<li>Silicone Watch Case</li>\n	<li>Wireless Charger</li>\n	<li>Notification: WhatsApp, Twitter, and Facebook</li>\n	<li>&nbsp;Function\n	<ul>\n		<li>Dialer / Phone Book / Heart rate / Blood pressure / Blood oxygen / Temperature / Multiple Sports mode / Calculator / Sleep monitor / Remote Music / Remote Camera / Reminder / Remote notifier / Weather / Stopwatch / Voice control / Location Share / Find phone</li>\n	</ul>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>Description</h2>\n\n<p>Y20 Ultra is a state-of-the-art wearable smart watch that will enhance your active lifestyle, so the smart watch comes with interesting features including heart rate, blood pressure, blood oxygen, temperature, calculator, sleep monitor, etc. It has a 2.2-inch HD large screen, which can easily read notifications, track fitness progress and easily access various functions. It comes with a 320mAh high-capacity polymer battery that can last for a long time.</p>', '', 1, 1, 0, 0, 'Pc', '', 0, '', 0, '', 1, 0.00, 0, 64, 0, 0, '2026-06-23 08:52:02', '2026-06-23 08:52:02'),
(3254, 'DT900 ULTRA 9 Smart Watch', 'dt900-ultra-9-smart-watch-1782204722-5072', 1, 1, NULL, 52, NULL, '208', NULL, NULL, '<p>Description</p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Affordable</li>\n	<li>Large, bright display</li>\n	<li>Heart rate monitoring</li>\n	<li>Blood oxygen monitoring</li>\n	<li>Sleep tracking</li>\n	<li>Step counting</li>\n	<li>Water resistance</li>\n	<li>Bluetooth calling</li>\n	<li>Music control</li>\n	<li>Heart rate monitoring: The DT 900 Ultra can track your heart rate 24/7, so you can see how active you are and how well your heart is functioning.</li>\n	<li>Blood oxygen monitoring: This feature can be used to measure the amount of oxygen in your blood, which can be helpful for tracking your overall health.</li>\n	<li>Sleep tracking: The DT 900 Ultra can track your sleep patterns, so you can see how much sleep you&rsquo;re getting and how well you&rsquo;re sleeping.</li>\n	<li>Step counting: This feature can help you track your daily steps and keep motivated to reach your fitness goals.</li>\n	<li>Water resistance: The DT 900 Ultra is water resistant up to 5ATM, so you can wear it in the shower or pool.</li>\n	<li>Bluetooth calling: The DT 900 Ultra can make and receive calls directly from your wrist, so you don&rsquo;t have to take your phone out of your pocket.</li>\n	<li>Music control: You can use the DT 900 Ultra to control music playback on your phone.</li>\n	<li>Other features: The DT 900 Ultra also has a built-in camera, alarm clock, and calendar.</li>\n</ul>', '', 0, 1, 0, 0, 'Pc', '', 0, '', 0, '', 1, 0.00, 0, 65, 0, 0, '2026-06-23 08:52:02', '2026-06-23 08:52:02'),
(3255, 'Laxasfit K10 Ultra Smart Watch With Sim Supported', 'laxasfit-k10-ultra-smart-watch-with-sim-supported-1782204722-4605', 1, 1, NULL, 52, NULL, '209', NULL, NULL, '<p><strong>K10 Ultra Smartwatch Features :-</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>\n	<p><strong>SIM Support :-</strong>&nbsp;Compatible with 2G/3G/4G SIM for calling and internet browsing.</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p><strong>Display :-&nbsp;</strong>2.1-inch HD touchscreen for clear and smooth navigation.</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p><strong>Battery :-</strong>&nbsp;380-500mAh battery providing up to a full day of usage.</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p><strong>Fitness Tracking :-</strong>&nbsp;Step counter, heart rate monitor, and sleep monitor.</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p><strong>Multifunctional Use :-&nbsp;</strong>Phone calls, messaging, notifications, and music playback.</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p><strong>Storage :-</strong>&nbsp;Built-in storage for saving songs and essential files.</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p><strong>Connectivity :-</strong>&nbsp;Bluetooth support for calls and app notifications.</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p><strong>Sports Modes :-&nbsp;</strong>Multiple sports tracking for fitness enthusiasts.</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p><strong>Water Resistance :-</strong>&nbsp;Protection against minor splashes.</p>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://img.drz.lazcdn.com/static/bd/p/375525ad98707a56c84d79688ddecedb.jpg_2200x2200q80.jpg_.webp\" /><img src=\"https://img.drz.lazcdn.com/static/bd/p/5bfeb2d10cd0ca4a1b9e659682376da8.jpg_2200x2200q80.jpg_.webp\" /><img src=\"https://img.drz.lazcdn.com/static/bd/p/c6ae7dc4e77c5fa72af1813fd9080fb0.jpg_2200x2200q80.jpg_.webp\" /><img src=\"https://img.drz.lazcdn.com/static/bd/p/4625d452520dfbd8fcb1d6a61f9cc908.jpg_2200x2200q80.jpg_.webp\" /></p>', '', 1, 1, 0, 0, 'Pc', '', 0, '', 0, '', 1, 0.00, 0, 66, 0, 0, '2026-06-23 08:52:02', '2026-06-23 08:52:02'),
(3256, 'Super Water Absorbing Quick Drying Floor Mat', 'super-water-absorbing-quick-drying-floor-mat-1782204722-4707', 1, 1, NULL, 55, NULL, '210', NULL, NULL, '<h1><strong>Product Details:&nbsp;</strong>Cobblestone Embossed Super Water Absorbing Quick Drying Floor Mat</h1>\n\n<h3>Let your kitchen, and bathroom no longer bear the damage of water stains and oil stains!</h3>\n\n<h3><img alt=\"undefined\" src=\"https://cdn.cloudfastin.top/image/af6b72ad5103e5449c8e0422eed057f9c904ec4f.webp\" /></h3>\n\n<h3>ALL THE PERFECTION IN A BATH MAT&hellip;</h3>\n\n<h3>It is made from Coral Velvet, It will undoubtedly change your life.</h3>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>\n	<h3>Amazingly soft and comfortable</h3>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<h3>Instant Water Absorption in 0,5s &amp; dries quickly</h3>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<h3>Relentless anti-slip safety</h3>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<h3>Machine wash and dry at will</h3>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><img alt=\"undefined\" src=\"https://cdn.cloudfastin.top/image/b7dcac3079351b0008b7a80c5eeca6fd4dd794e8.webp\" /></h3>\n\n<h3>ULTRA SOFT &amp; FLUFFY</h3>\n\n<h3>An incomparable feeling of softness. The pebbles hug the arch of the foot and store the heat from the floor heating systems with one goal in mind: your comfort.</h3>\n\n<h3><img alt=\"undefined\" src=\"https://cdn.cloudfastin.top/image/12e31f2467456be0fb720f06d0c7a6e6696627dc.webp\" /></h3>', '', 1, 1, 0, 0, 'Pc', '', 0, '', 0, '', 1, 0.00, 0, 67, 0, 0, '2026-06-23 08:52:02', '2026-06-23 08:52:02');
