duction of red blood cells.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Prevents Cancer: The antioxidant action of Premium Dried Fig (Teen Fol) assists in neutralizing free radicals within the body.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Maintains Bone Health: Rich in calcium and magnesium, figs are a delicious fruit for maintaining bone density and strength.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Helps in Losing and Gaining Weight: The dried fig is rich in fiber and low in fat; hence, it is considered an ideal diet for controlling weight.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Has Antioxidant Properties: Figs contain antioxidants such as flavonoids and phenolic acids that help fight against oxidative stress and inflammation and support the immune system.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Relieves Sore Throat: Premium Dried Fig (Teen Fol) has soothing properties that help in relieving sore throats.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Improves Eyesight: With high levels of vitamin A and antioxidants, dried figs can help protect the eyes from damage caused by oxidative stress.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Tina for Skin Beauty: This Premium Dried Fig, also known as Teen Fol, keeps your skin healthy because of the different minerals and vitamins it contains that glow the skin and keep it hydrated and young; aside from these benefits, this reduces wrinkles and fine-line signs.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Tina for Hair Care: The nutrient profile in this fruit contributes to the growth of hair, prevents its fall, and enhances the overall texture and luster of your hair. It nourishes the scalp and strengthens the roots of the hair.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Premium Dried Fig (Teen Fol) 500g Box Price in Bangladesh</p>\n\n<p>The latest Premium Dried Fig (Teen Fol) 500g Box price in Bangladesh on our Rokomari.com. Grab it now from us!</p>', '', 1, 1, 0, 0, 'Pc', '', 0, '', 0, '', 1, 0.00, 0, 1197, 0, 0, '2026-06-23 08:54:02', '2026-06-23 08:54:02'),
